

### 1. Create a new guest
POST http://localhost:3001/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weddingId": "WED-101",
    "name": "Rawan Mahmoud",
    "email": "Rawan@gmail.com",
    "phone": "01012345678"
}

### 2. Get all guests
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guests?weddingId=WED-101
### 3. Search guests
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guests/search?weddingId=WED-101&search=Rawan

### 4. Update guest
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/guests/e55a77c0-e3d6-41f7-b8b3-182f3aa4b93f
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rawan Mahmoud Updated"
}

### 5. Delete guest
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/guests/e55a77c0-e3d6-41f7-b8b3-182f3aa4b93f

### Submit RSVP - Confirmed
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/guests/invitations/a016db2f-fc6b-43e8-af30-ccbd726e4752
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rsvpStatus": "Confirmed"
}

### Test Invalid RSVP Status
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/guests/invitations/a016db2f-fc6b-43e8-af30-ccbd726e4752
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rsvpStatus": "Maybe"
}

### Test Invalid Invitation Token
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/guests/invitations/invalid-token-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rsvpStatus": "Confirmed"
}

### Test Duplicate Email
POST http://localhost:3001/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weddingId": "WED-101",
    "name": "Test Guest",
    "email": "Rawan@gmail.com",
    "phone": "01012345678"
}

### Test Missing Required Fields
POST http://localhost:3001/api/guests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weddingId": "WED-101",
    "email": "test@gmail.com"
}

### Test RSVP Tracking
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guests?weddingId=WED-101&rsvpDeadline=2026-12-31T23:59:59

### Test Overdue Guests
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guests?weddingId=WED-101&rsvpDeadline=2026-01-01T23:59:59
